&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze the tech and commercial performance of our Connectivity partners in EMEA &amp;amp; APAC, and define programs and initiatives to develop a mutually profitable partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate new API integration leads and co-develop GTM strategies based on company strategy and focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate insightful and data driven reports on Connectivity status quo and progress in the EMEA &amp;amp; APAC regions, and communicate key challenges and learnings to various internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and further develop Connectivity partner business management operations and strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in Account Management, Partner/API Integrations or Business Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, another language spoken in EMEA or APAC is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in leveraging generative &amp;amp; agentic AI (e.g. Claude Cowork) to accelerate day-to-day research, draft content, synthesize large volumes of data, and build agents and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional people and communication skills to build strong relationships with people on all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize tasks, pro-active attitude and ability to work autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
