&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:296;623-918&quot;&gt;Our Creator team sits at the heart of how GetYourGuide builds authentic connections with travellers through original content. We partner with creators across the globe to produce material that inspires people to explore, and we make sure that partnership runs smoothly, creatively, and at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:338;920-1257&quot;&gt;As Creator Growth Manager, you&#39;ll own the relationship with our active creator roster from onboarding through to ongoing performance. You&#39;ll keep creators briefed, motivated, and producing consistently great work, while building the workflows and incentive structures that let this programme scale without losing quality or authenticity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:106;1276-1381&quot;&gt;Act as the main point of contact for active and new creators, keeping relationships warm and productive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:172;1382-1553&quot;&gt;Brief creators clearly on objectives, hooks, angles, and brand direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:71;1554-1624&quot;&gt;Review all deliverables and give fast, specific, actionable feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:113;1625-1737&quot;&gt;Ensure deadlines are met and content quality stays consistently high across a large, concurrent creator roster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:121;1738-1858&quot;&gt;Own creator communications end to end across primary channels, acting as the voice of GetYourGuide to our creator base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:112;1859-1970&quot;&gt;Run regular outreach and activation loops across the active roster, understanding what keeps creators engaged&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:113;1971-2083&quot;&gt;Structure and propose workflows, templates, and processes that scale creator operations without losing quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:130;2084-2213&quot;&gt;Design and run incentive programmes with the Engagement Lead, including spotlights, milestone rewards, and activation campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
