&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GetYourGuide&#39;s On-Trip product group owns the entire post-booking experience: from the moment a traveler completes checkout through fulfillment, supplier coordination, to agentic care resolution. As GPM, you will lead a group of product managers, set strategy, coach a high-performing team, and drive measurable outcomes on some of the highest-leverage surfaces in the business. What you&#39;ll own:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-Trip Domain:&lt;/strong&gt; Fulfillment (contextual UX, self-service, modification and cancellation), AI Resolution (unified care and chat automation, currently resolving a significant share of contacts already with AI), and Supplier-Traveler Coordination (off-platform observability, supplier messaging, and coordination tooling).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage three PMs in Zurich. You report to the Director of Product, Traveler, who is based in Berlin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to synthesise a complex, multi-pillar strategy into a clear and opinionated thesis for executive audiences with a coherent point of view beyond executional updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and coaching junior/senior/lead PMs who own their own domains, with evidence that their output improved under your management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instinct: able to size problems with rough numbers, make ROI cases, and commit to metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record operating in an operationally complex domain — marketplace, payments, post-purchase, or customer service technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with occasional travel to Berlin for stakeholders and leadership engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extras that give you an edge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Familiarity with AI-assisted customer resolution, supplier-facing product, or payment corridors in a global marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
