&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supply Marketing sits at the powerful intersection of Marketing, Supply, Sales, Product, and Supplier Experience - the connective tissue that brings our supplier ecosystem to life. We’re the team that turns ambitious commercial goals into compelling stories, sharp campaigns, and seamless supplier journeys. We shape how the world’s best experience operators discover, choose, and grow with GetYourGuide, owning the full toolkit: from brand and content to performance,&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;field marketing, destination&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;partnerships, product marketing&lt;em&gt;, events, and original research&lt;/em&gt;. When supply teams scale faster, when suppliers feel proud to partner with us, and when our brand earns trust in the industry - that’s us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a strategic and hands-on marketing leader to take ownership of our full-funnel&amp;nbsp;Supply Marketing function: Brand, CRM &amp;amp; Lifecycle, Growth Marketing, Marketing Operations, Product Marketing, and Field Marketing - and accelerate how we attract, activate, and retain the experience operators who power our marketplace. This is a high-impact, high-visibility role: you’ll set the vision, sharpen the strategy, and rally cross-functional teams behind a clear plan for supplier growth. The role is based in Berlin and reports directly to the VP Supply and Sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and scale a bold, full-funnel marketing strategy built around the supplier journey - partnering with teams across the company to define and deliver against KPIs at every stage, from awareness to long-term loyalty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and grow a talented Supply Marketing team spanning B2B Performance Marketing, Brand, Product Marketing, and Field Marketing - creating an environment where ambitious marketers do their best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the kind of cross-functional partnerships that move the needle, working hand-in-hand with Sales, Supply, and Product to win our most strategic attractions and suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a sharp, data-informed point of view on the global activity operator landscape, and translate it into go-to-market strategies that resonate with suppliers’ real needs and behaviors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the supplier story at the highest level, reporting progress and strategic insights to our Executive team and influencing the direction of the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 7–10 years of progressive experience across Marketing, Business Development, Partnerships, or Operations &amp;amp; Project Management - including a track record of leading and developing high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a strategic thinker with strong commercial instincts: equally comfortable shaping the long-term plan and rolling up your sleeves to make things happen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re entrepreneurial, creative, and naturally curious - energized by ambiguity and motivated by the chance to build something that lasts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate with clarity and conviction, and you know how to align stakeholders from working teams up to the executive level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re fluent in data and in storytelling - and you use both to drive decisions and inspire action&lt;/li&gt;
