&lt;p&gt;The People Analytics and Rewards team plays a critical role in building the talent foundation the company needs to grow, by designing reward strategies and people insights that strengthen engagement, performance, and long-term organisational success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Global Head of Total Reward, the C&amp;amp;B Senior Manager will be responsible for driving the reward agenda Globally for GetYourGuide.&amp;nbsp; Acting as subject matter expert on Compensation and Benefits partnering with Global HR team in order to help attract, motivate and retain talent through competitive total rewards package and meaningful and fulfilling career journey.&lt;/p&gt;
