&lt;li&gt;Manage external benchmarking and market intelligence activities, including survey participation, vendor relationships, market trend analysis, and recommendations to maintain competitive reward positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and continuously improve reward processes, tools, playbooks, and governance, ensuring consistent, transparent, and efficient execution across countries, functions, and employee populations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare high quality reward analysis, business cases, and leadership materials, supporting executive-level decision-making on compensation, benefits, equity, and broader total reward priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively within the People Analytics and Rewards team, proactively supporting colleagues across day-to-day activities and strategic initiatives to ensure shared priorities are delivered effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
