&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to build and scale a best-in-class Connectivity platform that cements GetYourGuide as the world’s most reliable, flexible, and high-performing marketplace for travel experiences. We empower suppliers to efficiently manage high quality supply across multiple channels, ensure travelers enjoy seamless and accurate booking experiences, and maintain a thriving, innovative Connectivity ecosystem through strong partnerships and smart integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced and proactive Connectivity Partner Business Manager to drive our Partner Business Management to the next level in the Americas markets (North &amp;amp; South America). &lt;strong&gt;This is a full-time role, based in our New York office - you will need to be based in New York currently or happy to relocate, we would offer relocation support&lt;/strong&gt;. You will report to our Senior Team Lead - Business Operations &amp;amp; Strategy - Connectivity and your responsibilities are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Partner Connectivity in the Americas regions by defining and executing on our Connectivity strategy and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Americas Sales teams on tech and business related Connectivity topics e.g., in meetings with key suppliers and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the face of Connectivity in your markets and develop sustainable relationships with Connectivity partners in the regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze the tech and business performance of our Connectivity partners in Americas, and define programs and initiatives to develop a mutually profitable partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate new API integration leads and co-develop GTM strategies based on company strategy and focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate insightful reports on Connectivity status quo and progress in the Americas regions, and communicate key challenges and learnings to various internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in Account Management, Partner/API Integrations or Business Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, another language spoken in Americas is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
