&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CRM systems (e.g. Salesforce) and processing large-scale sales/event data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sales forecasting models or compensation/incentive design is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization and reporting tools (e.g. Looker, Tableau, Jupyter Notebooks).&lt;/li&gt;
