&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Growth Data Products (GDP) drives GetYourGuide&#39;s growth engine by transforming raw marketing data into reliable, self-service insights and automated decision systems. Our work spans every growth channel—Paid and Organic Search, Display Advertising, CRM and Lifecycle Marketing, Brand Marketing, Marketing Attribution, Experimentation, and Customer Lifetime Value measurement. We empower teams across the organization to make faster, smarter decisions at scale, turning data into actionable intelligence that fuels our mission to connect millions with unforgettable travel experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a valued member of our inclusive and dynamic team, you will collaborate closely with fellow Data Scientists, MLOps Engineers, and business stakeholders continuously innovating to enhance the quality of our marketplace catalog. Together, we strive to make every travel experience unforgettable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop innovative data products that not only enable suppliers to delight our customers but also drive the success of our company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of projects, guiding them from the initial business challenge to the deployment of production code. This includes:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing large datasets to uncover meaningful insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and maintaining robust data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishing rigorous evaluation and monitoring strategies, as well as in-production guardrails. Monitoring and optimizing data products after deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of our machine learning infrastructure and help establish best practices that will shape our future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional technology and business teams, leveraging your unique perspective to solve complex and exciting problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the continuous improvement and growth of our team, including participating in recruiting efforts to bring in new talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your toolkit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp; You have 5+ years of experience deploying ML models in production coupled with a solid understanding of ML techniques and their practical applications. Experience deploying and maintaining ML models in production is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;. Ability to turn data into actionable insights for business stakeholders. Experience with hypothesis testing and proficiency in analytics tools (e.g., pandas/polars) and SQL/Spark.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with LLMs and Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt;. You have experience working in production with prompt design, tool use, orchestration (e.g., LangChain), retrieval/RAG, evaluator design, guardrails, and tracing/observability is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Proficiency in Python&lt;/strong&gt;. Knowledge of distributed machine learning and computing frameworks (e.g., Spark) is beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen.&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience in a fast-paced business environment, demonstrating result-driven work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication.&lt;/strong&gt; Strong skills in explaining complex concepts to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
