&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager, you will be an integral part of a cross-functional team, working closely with other product managers, engineers, UX designers, researchers, and data professionals. Your role involves creating and executing a vision for a product area, constantly learning from our customers, and iterating to improve the user experience. You will also collaborate with our UX team, composed of product designers, researchers, and writers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;891&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager who can imagine GetYourGuide beyond its current state, advocate for our users, and turn a bold vision into reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1051&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Successful PMs at GetYourGuide bring a growth mindset, create measurable business and customer impact, identify high-leverage opportunities, build alignment with stakeholders, and execute with clarity and urgency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the vision and strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for a connectivity product area, translating it into clear priorities and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a portfolio&lt;/strong&gt; that includes both platform capabilities and partner-/supplier-facing integration experiences, balancing speed with long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable integration foundations&lt;/strong&gt;: define standards, reusable patterns, and self-serve capabilities that reduce manual work and improve reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive decision quality and alignment&lt;/strong&gt; across Product, Engineering, Operations, and Commercial teams—making tradeoffs explicit and keeping stakeholders informed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use data and customer insight&lt;/strong&gt; to identify the highest-leverage opportunities, measure success and iterate based on outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of product management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with &lt;strong&gt;platform and/or integration products&lt;/strong&gt; (APIs, developer experience, authentication, webhooks, versioning, documentation, partner tooling, migrations/deprecations, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to lead &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional, multi-stakeholder initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, including collaboration with commercial/ops teams and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills: ability to define success metrics, interpret data and make evidence-based prioritization decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we’ll make your career journey extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal growth budget and mentorship programs for continuous learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
