&lt;p&gt;The Strategy &amp;amp; Corporate Development team’s mission is to support the creation and execution of innovative strategies that will help GetYourGuide harness its competitive advantage. We have a seat at the table and are able to navigate between big picture views and an analytical mindset to enable our Management team to make optimal decisions to achieve our company&#39;s mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in the Berlin headquarters and reporting to the Director of Strategy &amp;amp; Corporate Development you will partner with senior leaders across the company and play a vital part in informing and shaping strategy discussions by conducting in-depth market and competitive research, develop strategy recommendations and support the company strategy process. But it does not end here - you will also be involved in the quarterly OKR process and Quarterly Business Reviews to turn strategy into execution and see the results come to live.&lt;/p&gt;
