&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &lt;em&gt;Mission - Top Points of Interest&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a team we are driven by a singular vision: to curate the world&#39;s most exceptional customer experience and inventory at the most visited attractions in the world such as Disneyland, Eiffel Tower, Louvre Museum, and Broadway. These locations behave differently than other less demanded locations and therefore require customized and cross-functional strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Categories team, takes on a category-specific focus on the experiences that matter most to travelers. Our mission is to own and grow a portfolio of Entrance ticket categories — spanning both established and emerging segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a senior strategic leader to lead a team of Senior Managers who build the strategies, partnerships, and capabilities across distinct categories.&amp;nbsp; You will set the vision and direction for how GetYourGuide enters and scales specific verticals&amp;nbsp; This role reports into the Head of Top Points of Interest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
