&lt;li&gt;Assess and prioritise sub-categories based on market opportunity, traveler demand, and strategic fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate market analysis and traveler insights into a clear roadmap for growing each sub-category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the value proposition and go-to-market approach for each sub-category, driving performance across both established and emerging segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the end-to-end performance and growth of each sub-category, setting clear goals, milestones, and success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment with Product, Marketing, Sales, and other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and grow a team of Go-to-Market Managers, each responsible for owning and scaling an individual sub-category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report monthly progress across all sub-categories to key stakeholders, including the Executive team. Stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the team&#39;s strategy and results with clarity and conviction, driving buy-in and resource allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define team ways of working, playbooks, and processes to enable scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
