&lt;li&gt;You have 5 to 10 years work experience, incl. people management. Either at a large tech company (&amp;gt; € 1 billion annual revenue), Start-up and/or at McKinsey &amp;amp; Company, Boston Consulting Group, or Bain &amp;amp; Company&lt;/li&gt;
