&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be an integral member of our People Team, based in Zurich, collaborating closely with the Workplace team in Berlin and the People Operations/Experience Manager in Zurich, as well as liaising with our IT team and external vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workplace Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee day-to-day office operations across both Zurich locations (main office and coworking space), ensuring each is functional, safe, and welcoming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own ordering and stock management of office and Food &amp;amp; Beverage/pantry supplies for the coworking location&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate front desk duties, including greeting visitors, managing in/outgoing mail and packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage local vendors and service providers (cleaning, catering, maintenance, coworking space)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain monthly facility checklists for both locations and liaise regularly with the Workplace team in Berlin on standards, processes, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize and maintain workstations, meeting rooms, and shared spaces, and manage simple maintenance issues and repair requests end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employee Experience&lt;/p&gt;
