&lt;li&gt;Help promote a sense of community in line with our company culture: support the organization of company All-Hands, meet-ups, in-office lunches, and other employee perks and global events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support local events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding with office tours and ensure new hires feel set up across both office locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
