&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a Bachelor&#39;s/Master&#39;s program or completed study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EFTA/EU requirement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English (C1) and Swiss German (C1) skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available for at least 12 months, 32 hours/week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing multiple vendors, and locations simultaneously, with strong organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoying interacting with employees and maintaining our culture at GetYourGuide&lt;/li&gt;
